# Denylist mode — files clasp should NOT push.
# Everything else in this folder is pushed. This prevents future
# `clasp push` from deleting remote files we don't have locally.
#
# ⚠️ clasp reads THIS file, NOT .gitignore. Anything with a pushable extension
# (.gs / .js / .html, plus appsscript.json) that isn't ignored here gets pushed
# into the Apps Script project. A stray .js under .venv once got pushed and
# broke every server function ("TextEncoder is not defined"). Keep the Python /
# tooling / secret paths below ignored.

.git/**
.gitignore
node_modules/**

# Python tooling & CI (NOT Apps Script — must never be pushed)
.venv/**
__pycache__/**
.github/**
service_account.json
*.py
*.yml
*.yaml
*.txt
*.bak
*.sh

# Data / docs / assets
*.xlsx
*.md
*.png
logo/**
error_message.txt

# local secrets / config
.env
.env.example

# clasp / auth config
.clasp.json
.clasprc.json
.claspignore
